    "This folder must contain these two datasets:\n",
    "\n",
    "* `aifs-ea-an-oper-0001-mars-o96-1979-2023-6h-v8.zarr`\n",
    "* `aifs-ea-an-oper-0001-mars-n320-1979-2023-6h-v8.zarr`\n",
    "\n",
    "Set the variable before you start Jupyter:\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "export ANEMOI_DATASET_PATH=/path/to/your/datasets\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "You can also set it in the cell below, before the `assert` line, for example\n",
    "`os.environ[\"ANEMOI_DATASET_PATH\"] = \"/path/to/your/datasets\"`."
   ]
